{"id":"bc6be798712f24f2","group":"93","path":"93/93-prop-generated-congruence.md","title":"Generated Congruence","display":"Generated Congruence","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-prop-generated-congruence","aliases":["93-prop-generated-congruence"],"display":"Generated Congruence","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-congruence-lattice]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-prop-generated-congruence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-prop-generated-congruence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Generated Congruence"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" href=\"?note=135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" title=\"93-df-congruence-lattice\">93-df-congruence-lattice</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"prop-generated-congruence-—-Generated-Congruence\">prop-generated-congruence — Generated Congruence</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|^2\">\\(R\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|^2\\)</span> is a binary relation.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> are sourced from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" href=\"?note=135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" title=\"93-df-congruence-lattice\">93-df-congruence-lattice</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}generated\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land R\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|^2\n\\to \\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}(R)=\n\\bigcap\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):R\\subseteq\\theta\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}generated\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land R\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|^2\n\\to \\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}(R)=\n\\bigcap\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):R\\subseteq\\theta\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The antecedent makes the carrier and algebraic signature explicit. The displayed intersection is nonempty because the universal congruence belongs to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"prop-generated-congruence-—-Generated-Congruence","text":"prop-generated-congruence — Generated Congruence","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"135c0cfcbae1f3c5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"135c0cfcbae1f3c5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}$ and $\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)$ are sourced from [[93-df-congruence-lattice]] and [[93-df-congruence]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}$ and $\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)$ are sourced from [[93-df-congruence-lattice]] and [[93-df-congruence]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}generated\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land R\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|^2\n\\to \\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}(R)=\n\\bigcap\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):R\\subseteq\\theta\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)","display":false}],"bytes":1062,"backlinks":[{"id":"b782710fac9440e0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["6730349967b8ffce","30b341bfbd8b5301","135c0cfcbae1f3c5"]}